text:
۱- این چند روز تعطیلی اجباری فرصت خوبی شد تا به پیشنهاد 
@aliaalei
 بشینم و آیین‌نامه انضباطی جدید فیفا رو ترجمه کنم. حالا از سختی کار که بگذریم باید بگم من از همون اول متعجب شدم که چرا خود فدراسیون تا به حال چنین متن مهمی رو به فارسی منتشر نکرده.

Text_en:
1- These few days of forced vacation became a good opportunity to propose 
@aliaalei
 I will sit down and translate the new FIFA disciplinary code. Now, leaving aside the difficulty of the work, I must say that I was surprised from the very beginning why the federation itself has not published such an important text in Farsi.

Sheikh Mehdi Karroubi's letter to the experts;

I am amazed at the grave silence of some people in front of all this cruelty and destruction!!! Why is the courthouse of the Islamic system sitting on this black day?
As an observer of #leadership, you daily witness the slaughter of justice in the name of maintaining #power.

